     3	    """
     4	    Write a function count_nums which takes an array of integers and returns
     5	    the number of elements which has a sum of digits > 0.
     6	    If a number is negative, then its first signed digit will be negative:
     7	    e.g. -123 has signed digits -1, 2, and 3.
